{"id":"u-98ce3c14-8e6d-46bd-bd4a-040366b43e72","src":"community","title":"Torso and limbs","author":"Nate","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/d2w4wB-optimal-science-based-simple-bodybuilding","desc":"a very simple routine that can be progressed forever.\n\nthe principle of this routine is just to go 1-2 rir for 4-6 sets for each muscle group twice a week.\n\nsuggested day: \nsun: rest\nmon: day 1\ntue: day 2\nwed: rest\nthu: day 3\nfri: day 4\nsat: rest\n\nstart from 5 reps and add reps when the set feels easy until can do 8 reps. then add weight and start again. \n\npreferably add reps on the second set and followed by the first set\n\nexample\n\nworkout 1\nset 1: 5 reps\nset 2: 5 reps\n\nworkout 2\nset 1: 5 reps\nset 2: 6 reps\n\nworkout 3\nset 1: 6 reps\nset 2: 6 reps\n\ncontinue until reach 8 reps.\n\nu can change the exercise but preferably opt for more stable exercise\nmachine > barbell > dumbbell\n\nmake sure to eat on adequate caloric surplus and protein as well as get enough rest.\n\nbest of luck","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T14:37:34.052Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":5,"rpe":8.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8.5,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Wide Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pullover (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8.5,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Machine)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":10},{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":8.5,"rpeHi":10}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Machine)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":0,"x":2}]},{"n":"Squat (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hip Adductor (Machine)","sets":[{"r":0}]},{"n":"Tricep Pus